# NeMo Gym — code ownership
#
# Standard rules request code-owner review. The portable approval check in
# scripts/ci/check-review-approvals.sh enforces this same map on both hosts.
# Each package lists its specialist team and frontier-evals on
# the SAME line: approval from either team satisfies that rule. Both teams
# are requested, but approval from both is not required.
# A non-Frontier team containing exactly Ananth and Yuya is automatically
# satisfied by the portable check until its membership changes. Frontier Eval
# membership never counts toward activating a specialist team's requirement.
#
# Reviewer teams belong under gym_team. Membership is managed in GitHub;
# keep individual reviewers out of this file.
#
# GitHub uses the LAST matching rule. Keep overrides after broader rules.
# The current layout and the proposed package destinations are both covered
# while the package reorganization lands.
#
# Lines prefixed with `# suggest:` remain advisory. They are read by
# .github/workflows/suggest-reviewers.yml and do not require approval.

